0003,315.10989999999998,9,false],["booth where students could make Valentine’s",37.261800000000001,315.16389999999996,211.77179999999998,325.61289999999997,9,false],["cards for loved ones. Students were also invit-",37.000799999999998,325.66689999999994,211.73580000000004,336.11589999999995,9,false],["ed to a coffeehouse concert later that evening.",37.000799999999998,336.16989999999993,215.86679999999998,346.61889999999994,9,false],["Following the concert, a student explained the",37.2258,346.67289999999991,214.83180000000004,357.12189999999993,9,false],["gospel to the audience.",36.928800000000003,357.1758999999999,126.38880000000003,367.62489999999991,9,false],["199›› Five Love Languages",33.102000000000004,356.84899999999999,188.80514000000002,407.80399999999997,37.625,false],["The ministry in Minnesota State, Mankato,",36.387599999999999,395.85500000000002,198.37860000000009,406.30399999999997,9,false],["spent two weeks doing surveys aimed at",36.918599999999998,406.358,192.5016,416.80700000000002,9,false],["Valentines Day. Based on those results, they",36.873599999999996,416.86099999999999,204.08459999999997,427.31,9,false],["hosted an evangelistic meeting on the topic of",37.197599999999994,427.36399999999998,214.52459999999991,437.81299999999999,9,false],["the Five Love Languages and served “Better",37.035599999999995,437.86699999999996,204.38160000000002,448.31599999999997,9,false],["Than Sex” cake.",36.378599999999999,448.36999999999995,97.785600000000017,458.81899999999996,9,false],["200›› Car Smash Outreach",35.939100000000003,448.04899999999998,191.59902,499.00400000000002,37.625,false],["At the University of Northern Colorado, a",36.514800000000001,487.05489999999998,194.4828,497.50389999999999,9,false],["student organized a car smash outreach. The",36.919800000000002,497.55789999999996,208.43280000000004,508.00689999999997,9,false],["men had to fill out a Valentine’s survey in",37.108800000000002,508.06089999999995,194.48280000000011,518.50990000000002,9,false],["order to get the chance to smash on the car",37.009800000000006,518.56389999999999,204.85080000000002,529.01289999999995,9,false],["with a sledgehammer a few times. One of the",37.162800000000004,529.06689999999992,213.03179999999995,539.51589999999999,9,false],["questions on the survey read: “What does",36.928800000000003,539.56989999999996,198.58680000000012,550.01889999999992,9,false],["love mean to you?”",37.324800000000003,550.0729,112.95180000000002,560.52189999999996,9,false],["Spring",234.14520000000002,141.21399999999994,277.79720000000009,157.99999999999994,14,false],["201›› St. Patrick’s Day Dance",233.2191,144.75110000000001,397.02476000000001,195.70609999999999,37.625,false],["At Boise State, Campus Crusade hosted a",234.51480000000001,189.51709999999997,392.71679999999998,199.96609999999998,9,false],["dance on St. Patrick’s Day. At the dance, a",234.9288,200.02009999999996,395.42580000000004,210.46909999999997,9,false],["speaker dressed up as a monk shared the mes-",234.91980000000001,210.52309999999994,413.64180000000005,220.97209999999995,9,false],["sage of St. Patrick who lived in A.D. 342.",234.91980000000001,221.02609999999993,390.68280000000016,231.47509999999994,9,false],["202›› \u0007 Campus wide",233.93910000000002,220.71109999999999,357.70341999999999,271.66609999999997,37.625,false],["Easter Egg Hunt",297.09410000000003,248.83009999999996,369.82381999999996,259.66609999999997,8.9100000000000001,false],["At Lawrence Tech University, Campus Cru-",234.51680000000002,259.71709999999996,393.18608000000006,270.16609999999997,8.9550000000000001,false],["sade hid 1,000 plastic Easter eggs all over",234.91775000000004,270.22009999999995,389.99630000000002,280.66909999999996,8.9550000000000001,false],["campus. Inside each plastic egg were pieces",234.99794000000003,280.72309999999993,398.63009000000011,291.17209999999994,8.9550000000000001,false],["of candy and a piece of paper that pointed to",235.00685000000001,291.22609999999992,404.92055000000005,301.67509999999993,8.9550000000000001,false],["EveryStudent.com (an evangelistic website).",235.1405,301.7290999999999,397.75691,312.17809999999992,8.9550000000000001,false],["Instructions were also given inside the eggs for",235.21178,312.23209999999989,409.78540999999996,322.6810999999999,8.9550000000000001,false],["the students to bring their piece of paper to the",235.04249000000002,322.73509999999987,413.2335799999999,333.18409999999989,8.9550000000000001,false],["weekly meeting where they could win a grand",235.15832,333.23809999999986,408.32417000000009,343.68709999999987,8.9550000000000001,false],["prize. The meaning of Easter was shared during",235.12268,343.74109999999985,412.03964000000002,354.19009999999986,8.9550000000000001,false],["the weekly meeting. Also around campus were",235.04249000000002,354.24409999999983,410.86351999999999,364.69309999999984,8.9550000000000001,false],["ESC Easter posters. (see p. 98)",235.1405,364.74709999999982,348.32423000000006,375.19609999999983,8.9550000000000001,false],["Michigan State partnered with other Christian",235.1405,382.45009999999979,404.55524000000003,392.89909999999981,8.9550000000000001,false],["groups on campus and handed out 16,000 Eas-",234.92666,392.95309999999978,411.34465999999998,403.40209999999979,8.9550000000000001,false],["ter eggs. The gospel message was stuffed inside",235.04248999999996,403.45609999999976,413.1979399999999,413.90509999999978,8.9550000000000001,false],["each Easter egg, along with pieces of candy.",234.99793999999997,413.95909999999975,398.68354999999997,424.40809999999976,8.9550000000000001,false],["Colorado Boulder stuffed raffle tickets inside",234.85537999999997,431.66209999999978,399.24487999999997,442.11109999999974,8.9550000000000001,false],["their Easter eggs, inviting students to a free din-",235.04248999999996,442.16509999999977,411.46939999999995,452.61409999999978,8.9550000000000001,false],["ner. Local businesses donated prizes, including a",235.10485999999992,452.66809999999975,412.68115999999998,463.11709999999977,8.9550000000000001,false],["plane ticket one year and a DVD player",235.12267999999992,463.17109999999974,378.35983999999996,473.62009999999975,8.9550000000000001,false],["last year. Several students spoke of",235.31869999999992,473.67409999999973,363.30193999999989,484.12309999999974,8.9550000000000001,false],["how they met Christ and a guest",235.19395999999992,484.17709999999971,356.32540999999992,494.62609999999972,8.9550000000000001,false],["speaker retold the Easter story.",234.90883999999991,494.6800999999997,348.36877999999996,505.12909999999971,8.9550000000000001,false],["( 77 )",214.27090000000001,618.96010000000001,235.92080000000001,630.95010000000002,10,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",120.9309998,620.7502197,347.06899980000003,634.53021969999998,10,false]],"h":648,"ocr":false,"w":468},{"h":648,"w":468,"ocr":false,"segs":[["( the250 )",224.59450000000001,21.489599999999996,262.101,34.67859999999996,11,false],["203››“\n\u0007",53.939100000000003,236.92599999999999,121.69401999999999,287.88099999999997,37.625,false],["“\n\u0007",113.75970000000001,236.92599999999999,121.69402000000001,287.88099999999997,8.9100000000000001,false],["“\n\u0007",113.75970000000001,236.92599999999999,121.69402000000001,287.88099999999997,8.9100000000000001,false],["“\n\u0007 Hey, don’t spit",113.75970000000001,236.92599999999999,184.88936000000001,287.88099999999997,8.9100000000000001,false],["on that guy!”",119.4623,265.04499999999996,181.93436,275.88099999999997,8.9100000000000001,false],["For Easter, students at Indiana University carried",55.219000000000001,275.93199999999996,233.58828999999997,286.38099999999997,8.9550000000000001,false],["a cross through the campus and erected it in",54.8626,286.43499999999995,221.62216000000006,296.88399999999996,8.9550000000000001,false],["a central location. One of the guys was up on",54.8626,296.93799999999993,224.93668000000002,307.38699999999994,8.9550000000000001,false],["the cross and they had someone begin to mock",55.040799999999997,307.44099999999992,232.92003999999991,317.88999999999993,8.9550000000000001,false],["him and spit on him. A crowd gathered and",55.201180000000001,317.9439999999999,218.68186000000006,328.39299999999992,8.9550000000000001,false],["people reacted to it saying, “Hey, don’t spit on",55.120989999999999,328.44699999999989,229.63225,338.8959999999999,8.9550000000000001,false],["that guy!” Flyers announced, “Jesus Christ died",55.040799999999997,338.94999999999987,232.22506000000001,349.39899999999989,8.9550000000000001,false],["for you. What does that mean to you?” The",55.049709999999997,349.45299999999986,219.47485000000006,359.90199999999987,8.9550000000000001,false],["flyers advertised the weekly meeting and an",54.907149999999994,359.95599999999985,219.48376000000005,370.40499999999986,8.9550000000000001,false],["upcoming Easter service at a local church.",55.067529999999998,370.45899999999983,210.65395000000007,380.90799999999984,8.9550000000000001,false],["204›› \u0007 Easter Bunny, Bear,",53.939100000000003,370.12610000000001,204.71418,421.08109999999999,37.625,false],["and Pig",118.56240000000001,398.24509999999998,152.36946,409.08109999999999,8.9100000000000001,false],["At Michigan State, students dress up as the",54.514800000000001,409.13209999999998,219.84479999999999,419.58109999999999,9,false],["Easter Bunny, a bear, and a pig. Students",55.144800000000004,419.63509999999997,211.07880000000003,430.08409999999998,9,false],["could get their pictures taken with the charac-",55.000800000000005,430.13809999999995,230.69880000000001,440.58709999999996,9,false],["ters. Then students passed out cards directing",55.045799999999986,440.64109999999994,230.54579999999999,451.09009999999995,9,false],["people to the local Website where they could",55.126799999999989,451.14409999999992,228.42180000000008,461.59309999999994,9,false],["download their digital photos and also learn",54.928799999999988,461.64709999999991,223.80479999999991,472.09609999999992,9,false],["more about Campus Crusade. The characters",55.108799999999988,472.1500999999999,227.80979999999994,482.59909999999991,9,false],["also handed out Easter ads that ran simultane-",54.865799999999986,482.65309999999988,232.66079999999999,493.10209999999989,9,false],["ously in the campus newspaper.",55.009799999999984,493.15609999999987,177.17580000000001,503.60509999999988,9,false],["205›› \u0007 A “Passion Walk”",53.939100000000003,492.82600000000002,195.33852000000002,543.78099999999995,37.625,false],["around campus",117.05560000000001,520.94499999999994,187.54504000000003,531.78099999999995,8.9100000000000001,false],["Ohio University is on the quarter system, so",54.9024,531.83199999999999,218.54939999999999,542.28099999999995,9,false],["each quarter the ministry leaders plan an evan-",55.001399999999997,542.33500000000004,232.27440000000001,552.78399999999999,9,false],["gelistic outreach. For the spring quarter, they",54.929399999999987,552.83799999999997,223.71539999999987,563.28700000000003,9,false],["have “Faith Week,” completely student-run.",55.20839999999999,563.34100000000001,221.01540000000003,573.78999999999996,9,false],["The “Passion Walk” kicks off the first night.",54.389399999999988,581.04399999999998,221.56440000000003,591.49299999999994,9,false],["Students reenact the Passion of Christ, be-",54.704399999999985,591.54700000000003,217.1814,601.99599999999998,9,false],["ginning with the Lord’s Supper and going",54.929399999999987,602.04999999999995,213.88740000000001,612.49900000000002,9,false],["( 78 )",232.10480000000001,618.96010000000001,253.75470000000001,630.95010000000002,10,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",120.9309998,620.7502197,347.06899980000003,634.53021969999998,10,false],["through the Resurrection. This event takes",253.04640000000001,142.57299999999992,414.24540000000002,153.02199999999993,9,false],["place on different sites around campus and",253.12739999999999,153.07599999999991,418.12439999999992,163.52499999999992,9,false],["generates a lot of publicity.",252.92939999999999,163.57899999999989,356.54640000000001,174.02799999999991,9,false],["206››“\n\u0007",251.93910000000002,163.245,320.47471999999999,214.19999999999999,37.625,false],["“\n\u0007",312.39915000000008,163.245,320.47471999999999,214.19999999999999,8.9100000000000001,false],["“\n\u0007",312.39915000000008,163.245,320.47471999999999,214.19999999999999,8.9100000000000001,false],["“\n\u0007 Where’s the Body?”",312.39915000000008,163.245,408.27778000000001,214.19999999999999,8.9100000000000001,false],["Campaign",318.47790000000003,191.36399999999998,364.61532,202.19999999999999,8.9100000000000001,false],["At the University of Idaho, Christian groups",252.51680000000002,202.25099999999998,413.47595000000001,212.69999999999999,8.9550000000000001,false],["partnered together for “Where’s the Body?”",253.12268000000003,212.75399999999996,420.2475500000001,223.20299999999997,8.9550000000000001,false],["campaign (similar to I Agree with). Students",252.99794000000003,223.25699999999995,416.29151000000013,233.70599999999996,8.9550000000000001,false],["wore T-shirts emblazoned on the back with the",253.15832000000003,233.75999999999993,429.82579999999996,244.20899999999995,8.9550000000000001,false],["question, “Where’s the Body?” On the front",252.92666000000003,244.26299999999992,419.32982000000004,254.71199999999993,8.9550000000000001,false],["of the shirt students printed the inviting words,",253.00685000000001,254.76599999999991,428.73877999999996,265.21499999999992,8.9550000000000001,false],["“Ask me, I know.” Additionally, ESC ads were",249.03299000000001,265.26899999999989,418.8932299999999,275.7179999999999,8.9550000000000001,false],["placed in the newspaper daily. The answer to",253.12268,275.77199999999988,421.61968999999999,286.22099999999989,8.9550000000000001,false],["the question, “Where’s the Body?” (referring,",253.04249000000002,286.27499999999986,424.23032000000001,296.72399999999988,8.9550000000000001,false],["of course, to Christ’s body) came on Friday’s",253.00685000000001,296.77799999999985,417.6814700000001,307.22699999999986,8.9550000000000001,false],["paper in an article written by Campus Crusade",253.12268,307.28099999999984,426.84986000000015,317.72999999999985,8.9550000000000001,false],["staff member and author Josh McDowell.",252.91775000000001,317.78399999999982,408.33488,328.23299999999983,8.9550000000000001,false],["207›› Easter Outreach Banquet",251.93910000000002,317.44499999999999,426.69400000000007,368.39999999999998,37.625,false],["Campus Crusade at the University of Buffalo",252.85680000000002,356.45099999999996,422.65080000000012,366.89999999999998,9,false],["hosts a formal Easter banquet every year. Tick-",253.20780000000002,366.95399999999995,430.38180000000006,377.40299999999996,9,false],["ets were sold to the other groups on campus.",253.00080000000003,377.45699999999994,427.27680000000015,387.90599999999995,9,false],["Each year, 50 percent of those who attend are",253.14480000000003,387.95999999999992,430.21980000000002,398.40899999999993,9,false],["non-believers.",253.10880000000003,398.46299999999991,306.99180000000001,408.91199999999992,9,false],["208›› Easter Week at UTEP",251.93910000000002,398.14490000000001,408.51064000000008,449.09989999999999,37.625,false],["Students involved in Destino at the University",252.7056,437.15089999999998,425.13660000000004,447.59989999999999,9,false],["of El Paso used the ESC Easter campaign. They",253.01160000000002,447.65389999999996,430.75260000000003,458.10289999999998,9,false],["created T-shirts. They hosted bands, dramas",253.00260000000003,458.15689999999995,420.91559999999993,468.60589999999996,9,false],["and break-dancers, and they invited different",252.86760000000004,468.65989999999994,424.66860000000008,479.10889999999995,9,false],["speakers to discuss relevant topics. Each semi-",252.921600000000